@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "SDG 9 Alignment: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure";
}

<div class="bg-emerald-dark text-white py-5">
    <div class="container text-center py-4">
        <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark px-3 py-2 rounded-pill fw-bold mb-2">UNITED NATIONS SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT GOALS</span>
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-extrabold mb-3">SDG 9 Alignment Report</h1>
        <p class="lead text-white-75 max-w-700 mx-auto">
            How Ad-Diin leverages modern software engineering, AI, and digital infrastructure to modernize religious institution management.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
            <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">Target 9.c & 9.1: Universal Digital Infrastructure & Innovation</h2>
            <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
                Traditionally, community mosques and Islamic centers in developing nations have relied on manual paper ledgers, fragmented announcement bulletin boards, and non-transparent cash donation boxes.
            </p>
            <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
                <strong>Ad-Diin</strong> redefines this paradigm by deploying resilient digital public infrastructure that fosters transparency, civic trust, and equal access to Islamic knowledge and financial services.
            </p>
            <div class="p-3 bg-emerald-light rounded-3 border border-emerald border-opacity-25">
                <h6 class="fw-bold text-emerald-dark mb-1"><i class="bi bi-shield-check me-2"></i> Transparent Zakat & Philanthropy</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Every transaction is digitally tracked with unique transaction tokens (TranId), instant validation receipts, and category-wise transparent allocation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="card card-custom p-4 p-md-5 border rounded-4 bg-white shadow-sm">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-emerald mb-3"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill me-2"></i> SDG 9 Pillars in Ad-Diin</h5>
                <ul class="list-unstyled space-y-3 mb-0">
                    <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="bg-emerald text-white p-2 rounded-circle fs-6">
                            <i class="bi bi-1-circle-fill"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Digital Institution Management:</strong> Replacing archaic registers with secure cloud-ready MVC architecture and Microsoft SQL Server.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="bg-emerald text-white p-2 rounded-circle fs-6">
                            <i class="bi bi-2-circle-fill"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>AI-Assisted Knowledge Democratization:</strong> Diin AI provides 24/7 authentic Quran & Hadith citations for learners of all ages.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="bg-emerald text-white p-2 rounded-circle fs-6">
                            <i class="bi bi-3-circle-fill"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>FinTech Integration:</strong> Seamless mobile financial services (bKash, Nagad, Cards) enabling accessible community funding.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>